{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_48_1050970337#3_1900125130","relevance":2,"reason":"The full NPS document directly discusses climate change in Death Valley National Park, including predicted warmer and drier conditions and study of changes over the last hundred years, but it is not dedicated specifically to Zabriskie Point or to quantified climate changes there.","learned":"NPS states Death Valley is vulnerable to climate change and faces a warmer, drier future; species responses to climate shifts over the last hundred years are being studied."},"action":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"death valley\" (+ warming warmed hotter) (+ trend trends \"climate change\"))","reason":"Look for documents with direct evidence of observed warming trends in Death Valley, the park containing Zabriskie Point, which may better answer how the local climate has changed."}}
{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"death valley\" (+ warming warmed hotter) (+ trend trends \"climate change\"))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_27_761872905#5_1540987058","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q1557","rank":1,"snippet":"region where many had hoped a strong El Nino would stave off these kinds of climate change related impacts for at least another few years. And for these reasons along with the direct risks of heat injury to human beings, interests should closely monitor its development. Links: US Drought Monitor Quick Oregon Snowmelt Dampens Water Outlook US Climate Data Pivotal Weather NCEP/NOAA Hat tip to Zack Labe Hat tip to DT Lange Hat tip to Colorado Bob Like this: Like Loading... Like 15 bloggers like this. 20 Comments by robertscribbler on June 14, 2016 • Permalink Posted in Climate Change Tagged <cover>climate change, Death Valley Like Heatwave, global warming, </cover>heat dome, Record Southwest Heatwave Predicted, Ridiculously Resilient Ridge Posted by robertscribbler on June 14, 2016 https://robertscribbler.com/2016/06/14/death-valley-like-heat-predicted-to-blanket-the-southwest-by-next-week/\" , \"start_char\": 2864.000000 , \"title\": \"Death Valley Like Heat Predicted to Blanket the Southwest By Next Week | robertscribbler\" , \"url\": \"https://robertscribbler.com/2016/06/14/death-valley-like-heat-predicted-to-blanket-the-southwest-by-next-week/\" }"}}
