{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_01_1809342308#3_2668230960","relevance":2,"reason":"This broad Death Valley facts page directly supports environmental/climate change at Zabriskie Point by stating it is composed of sediments from Furnace Creek Lake, which dried up 5 million years ago, but the document is not dedicated to answering Zabriskie Point's climate change.","learned":"Another source states Zabriskie Point records sediments of ancient Furnace Creek Lake, which dried up about 5 million years ago, supporting a shift from lake conditions to modern aridity."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q1612","reason":"The Zabriskie Point/Furnace Creek Lake query continues to return direct supporting evidence; continue to see whether more dedicated Zabriskie Point geology/climate-history pages appear."}}
{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q1612"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_54_1471989700#12_3122952727","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q1612","rank":7,"snippet":"trail length is one mile. 6. Devil’s Golf Course 7. Furnace Creek 8. Father Crowley Overlook Other Things To Do In Death Valley National Park When Is The Best Time To Visit Death Valley? Death Valley In One Day: Example Itinerary Day 1: Day 2: Camping In Death Valley Map of Things To See In Death Valley National Park More Southwest Adventures \" , \"segment\": \"Have fun! Try and taste the salt if you’re brave! 4. Zabriskie Point<cover>Zabriskie Point is a viewpoint that displays a panoramic view of the eroding landscape of the Amargosa Range. This is an area of settled sediment from the ancient Furnace Creek lake </cover>bed, and the weather and rain slowly erode the delicate structure away. Thus creating the deep grooves you see today! The yellow and brown colors in the hills are different sand and sediments that settled on the bottom in layers many years ago. Coined as Death Valley’s “Badlands”, this area is a perfect pit stop while driving through Death Valley in one day. It’s an easy pullout from Highway 190. Love Photography?\" , \"start_char\": 6041.000000","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_54_1471989700#11_3122950742","rank":6,"relevance":1}]}}
